{"version":1,"content":"<p>被指今年初才與商台破冰的男團MIRROR，今天（4日）由王智德（Alton）、邱士縉（Stanley）、李駿傑（Jeremy）及陳瑞輝（Frankie）代表，出席商台於昂坪市集舉行的《叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》發布會。</p><p>Alton解釋，其餘隊友各有工作安排，副隊長江𤒹生（AK）則因感冒未癒而缺席。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:45:52.540302+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:03:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:19.220076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:24.567269+00:00","content_hash":"b3c84cb30c85d0eaa6b8f9b9cc740f0f2a0351c298a838544e717a56a24cd467","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}